[Mission.Objectives]
Liberate the village from the Nazi-German invaders.
[Mission.Description]
The enemy troops are fleeing! In just a few days our counter offensive has reached Volokolamsk. General Headquarters has tasked you to pursue and eliminate any remaining enemy units or strong points in your sector of the front.

Your order is to:
- Liberate the village from the Nazi-German invaders.
[Mission.Success]
You have liberated the village. GHQ’s order has been fulfilled!
[Mission.Failed]
You failed to fulfill GHQ’s order!
[Submission_1.Objectives]
Liberate the settlement.
[Submission_1.Description]
To the northwest there is a settlement, which the Germans have made a key stronghold along the approach to Volokolamsk. This is a strategically important artery and most be secured. 

Your orders are to:
- Destroy the enemy defenses using all forces available.
- Liberate the settlement from the invaders.
[Submission_1.Success]
GHQ’s orders have been fulfilled!
[Submission_1.Failed]
You failed to fulfill orders from GHQ. Your troops were defeated.
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Destroy the enemy forces.
[Submission_2.Description]
The Germans have switched to an active defense and have begun to send out small probing groups. Our scouts have noticed the advancing enemy.

Your order is to:
-Destroy the advancing enemy troops.
[Submission_2.Success]
The enemy troops were defeated. Your task has been fulfilled!
[Submission_2.Failed]
You failed to fulfill your orders! Your troops were defeated.
[Submission_3.Objectives]
Repel the enemy counter-attack.
[Submission_3.Description]
The settlement has been occupied by our troops but the Germans don’t intend to let us rest just yet. Even now they are preparing to launch a counter-attack from the north.

Your order is to:
- Repel the enemy counterattack.
[Submission_3.Success]
The enemy counter-attack was repelled. Your order has been fulfilled!
[Submission_3.Failed]
You failed to fulfill GHQ’s order! You failed to hold on to the positions you had earlier fought so hard to occupy.